# 一律 LF（privacy-scan 会拦不该有的 CRLF）；Windows 的批处理用 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制（privacy-scan 缺省也拦二进制；真要放的在 .privacy-scan.json 的 allowBinary 里点名）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
